# INVWINTA.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the works state,
# the condition and the tags of the item form, and the Works column of
# the item list, which shows yes for item 1 and no for item 2 of the
# seed.  Item 1 in edit mode: F4 in Works lists the four states by name,
# its Y selected, and I is chosen; F4 in Condition lists the grades, its
# GD selected, and EXC is chosen; F4 in Tags, with no tag in use, shows
# an empty list titled so.  Tags typed with blanks, commas and a repeat
# in another case are saved as the server keeps them, each once, joined
# by single commas; the list shows intrm for item 1.  Item 2: F4 in Tags
# lists the tags in use, A-Z, the longest tag whole; a tag chosen is
# added after a comma, and one the field holds already leaves it as it
# was; with the field nearly full, a tag that does not fit leaves it too
# and is refused under the fields, until one that fits clears the line.
# The end by Exit, the changes left unsaved.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINTA.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
S LIST
K CTRL-E
S EDIT
# Works: Y selected, I chosen
K ALT-W F4
S WORKS
K DOWN ENTER
S WORKSI
# Condition: GD selected, EXC chosen
K ALT-I F4
S CONDS
K UP ENTER
S CONDEXC
# Tags: none in use yet
K ALT-G F4
S NOTAGS
K ESC
T Retro, ISA  retro,,twelve-chars
K ENTER
S SAVED
K ENTER
S VIEW1
K ESC
# item 2: the tags in use, A-Z; the last, then the first, added
K DOWN CTRL-E ALT-G F4
S TAGLIST
K END ENTER
S ADDED
K F4 HOME ENTER
S ADDED2
# a tag the field holds: no change
K F4 END ENTER
S REPEAT
# the field nearly full: no room for ISA
K ALT-G
T aaaaaaaaaaaa,bbbbbbbbbbbb,cccccccccccc,dddddddddddd,eeeeeeee
K F4 HOME ENTER
S NOROOM
# a tag that fits clears the refusal
K ALT-G
T x
K F4 HOME ENTER
S CLEARED
K ESC Y ALT-F X
